      "zh": "UniCO-Fuel · CO₂ 制 EPI 燃料",
      "en": "UniCO-Fuel · CO₂ to EPI fuel"
    },
    "description": {
      "zh": "UniCO-Fuel 提出将火星大气 CO₂ 经光催化转化为甲醇，再由工程毕赤酵母通过 MVA 通路与 EIZS 合成 epi-Isozizaene（EPI），经两相萃取与纯化获得候选高能液体燃料。方案结合辅因子调节、蓝光 CRISPRi 动态代谢调控、光衰减模型及多层生物安全防护。",
      "en": "UniCO-Fuel proposes photocatalytic conversion of Martian atmospheric CO₂ to methanol, followed by engineered Pichia pastoris using the MVA pathway and EIZS to produce epi-Isozizaene (EPI). Two-phase extraction and purification yield a candidate high-energy liquid fuel. The design includes cofactor regulation, blue-light CRISPRi metabolic control, a light attenuation model and layered biosafety measures."
    },
